// "Resistance to acid, cold, fire, lightning, and thunder" -- `ProtectingWard`'s
// `DamageReduction` has no per-damage-type filter: it blunts ALL incoming
// damage identically, not any specific element. Same primitive reused here
// as a generic damage-reduction ward; the i18n description is written to
// avoid naming specific damage types the mechanic can't actually filter for.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: ProtectingWard, data: BuffData(strength: 0.35, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 110.0,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Abjuration),
        source: Some(Primordial),
        // level 6 spell -> min_level 36, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(36)),
    ),
)
